    11	//! ## The cardinal invariant (spec §7)
    12	//! **Resolve-or-fall-through, NEVER a wrong target.** A bare name that fails to
    13	//! resolve returns `Unresolved`/`Ambiguous`/`Poisoned` — the engine never
    14	//! silently picks a wrong outer same-name item. Every shadow/poison/visibility
